  "description": "The Leucadia is our perfect bike that will inspire any rider about to get his Freestyle moves into action. Perfect bike to ride to school or hit up the local park or pump track. Comes with Haro's own custom design Cr-Mo 3-Piece tubular cranks and sprocket, as well as the new Haro 2.4\" La Mesa tires Team grips and Topload molded stem.\nHi-ten frame with 18.5\" or 20.5\" top tube\nFull hi-ten fork with tapered legs\nHi-ten bars 8.5\" with Haro 1978 alloy top load stem\nHaro 1978 3-piece chromoly 8-spline 165mm (on 18.5\") or 170mm (on 20.5\") cranks with loose ball USA BB\n25/9 gearing with sealed bearing 9T driver\nHaro padded fully adjustable seat\nHaro La Mesa tires 20x2.4\" front/rear\nHaro Team grips",
